    "category": "tactic_zwischenzug",
    "text": "中间这一拍，抢得妙。",
    "file": "leo_tactic_zwischenzug_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_tactic_zwischenzug_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "tactic_zwischenzug",
    "text": "你打乱了交换的出场顺序。",
    "file": "leo_tactic_zwischenzug_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_tactic_zwischenzug_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "tactic_zwischenzug",
    "text": "该回吃时先出招，漂亮的转折。",
    "file": "leo_tactic_zwischenzug_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_tactic_sacrifice_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "tactic_sacrifice",
    "text": "弃子开场，主动权压轴！",
    "file": "leo_tactic_sacrifice_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_tactic_sacrifice_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "tactic_sacrifice",
    "text": "你舍掉一枚，却赢来整段节奏。",
    "file": "leo_tactic_sacrifice_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_tactic_sacrifice_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "tactic_sacrifice",
    "text": "这枚子，是为后面的好戏铺路。",
    "file": "leo_tactic_sacrifice_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_tactic_sacrifice_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "tactic_sacrifice",
    "text": "代价付得大胆，补偿拿得漂亮。",
    "file": "leo_tactic_sacrifice_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_key_threat_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "key_threat",
    "text": "下一幕会很危险，准备好了？",
    "file": "leo_key_threat_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_key_threat_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "key_threat",
    "text": "我把威胁推到台前了。",
    "file": "leo_key_threat_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_key_threat_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "key_threat",
    "text": "现在得回答，不能等散场。",
    "file": "leo_key_threat_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_key_threat_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "key_threat",
    "text": "这个问题，你躲不开的。",
    "file": "leo_key_threat_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_check_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "check",
    "text": "将军！镜头转向你的王。",
    "file": "leo_check_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_check_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "check",
    "text": "王被点名，先别忙别的。",
    "file": "leo_check_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_check_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "check",
    "text": "你的王，该接这一句了！",
    "file": "leo_check_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_check_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "check",
    "text": "将军落下，节奏归我。",
    "file": "leo_check_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_player_check_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "player_check",
    "text": "你将军？好，紧张起来了。",
    "file": "leo_player_check_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_player_check_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "player_check",
    "text": "我的王也有被抢镜的时候。",
    "file": "leo_player_check_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_player_check_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "player_check",
    "text": "这一声将军，我接下了。",
    "file": "leo_player_check_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_player_check_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "player_check",
    "text": "压力到我这边，看看怎么化解。",
    "file": "leo_player_check_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_missed_mate_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "missed_mate",
    "text": "刚才可以将杀！你放走了高潮。",
    "file": "leo_missed_mate_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_missed_mate_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "missed_mate",
    "text": "终幕近在眼前，可惜没落下。",
    "file": "leo_missed_mate_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_missed_mate_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "missed_mate",
    "text": "杀棋擦过，这幕得记下来。",
    "file": "leo_missed_mate_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_missed_mate_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "missed_mate",
    "text": "你把本该结束的故事续上了。",
    "file": "leo_missed_mate_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_blunder_into_mate_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "blunder_into_mate",
    "text": "这一步，把结局提前了。",
    "file": "leo_blunder_into_mate_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_blunder_into_mate_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "blunder_into_mate",
    "text": "你的王走进了必杀的终幕。",
    "file": "leo_blunder_into_mate_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_blunder_into_mate_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "blunder_into_mate",
    "text": "出口已闭，剧情收束。",
    "file": "leo_blunder_into_mate_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_blunder_into_mate_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "blunder_into_mate",
    "text": "将杀的路线，被你亲手接通了。",
    "file": "leo_blunder_into_mate_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_mate_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "mate",
    "text": "将杀！幕布落下。",
    "file": "leo_mate_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_mate_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "mate",
    "text": "终场，所有出口都关了。",
    "file": "leo_mate_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_mate_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "mate",
    "text": "王已经没有下一场戏。",
    "file": "leo_mate_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_mate_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "mate",
    "text": "这一盘，以将杀收尾。",
    "file": "leo_mate_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_castling_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "castling",
    "text": "易位换景，王车就位！",
    "file": "leo_castling_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_castling_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "castling",
    "text": "王退到安全处，车准备接班。",
    "file": "leo_castling_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_castling_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "castling",
    "text": "两枚棋子，一起换了部署。",
    "file": "leo_castling_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_castling_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "castling",
    "text": "这次易位，像一次利落的转场。",
    "file": "leo_castling_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_promotion_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "promotion",
    "text": "升变！小兵拿到主演的位置。",
    "file": "leo_promotion_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_promotion_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "promotion",
    "text": "一路到底，新角色登场！",
    "file": "leo_promotion_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_promotion_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "promotion",
    "text": "兵走完远路，换来了全新戏份。",
    "file": "leo_promotion_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_promotion_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "promotion",
    "text": "升变落定，舞台的重量变了。",
    "file": "leo_promotion_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player",
      "opponent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_queen_early_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "queen_early",
    "text": "后登场太早，节奏可要付钱。",
    "file": "leo_queen_early_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_queen_early_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "queen_early",
    "text": "主角跑得快，配角还没出门。",
    "file": "leo_queen_early_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_queen_early_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "queen_early",
    "text": "你急着出后，反倒被追着跑。",
    "file": "leo_queen_early_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_queen_early_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "queen_early",
    "text": "这么早亮主角，容易被抢戏啊。",
    "file": "leo_queen_early_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_defense_found_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "defense_found",
    "text": "守得漂亮！这一幕没有垮。",
    "file": "leo_defense_found_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_defense_found_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "defense_found",
    "text": "最窄的退路，你还是找到了。",
    "file": "leo_defense_found_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_defense_found_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "defense_found",
    "text": "这次防守，足够换来掌声。",
    "file": "leo_defense_found_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_defense_found_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "defense_found",
    "text": "压力越大，这一手越有价值。",
    "file": "leo_defense_found_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_player_missed_tactic_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "player_missed_tactic",
    "text": "战术伏笔在那儿，你没接住。",
    "file": "leo_player_missed_tactic_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_player_missed_tactic_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "player_missed_tactic",
    "text": "机会登场，又悄悄退场了。",
    "file": "leo_player_missed_tactic_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_player_missed_tactic_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "player_missed_tactic",
    "text": "别只看眼前，后面还有连招。",
    "file": "leo_player_missed_tactic_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_player_missed_tactic_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "player_missed_tactic",
    "text": "可惜，这里本来能演得更精彩。",
    "file": "leo_player_missed_tactic_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_comeback_01",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "comeback",
    "text": "反转！你把局面救回来了。",
    "file": "leo_comeback_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_comeback_02",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "comeback",
    "text": "还没散场，你又抢回了节奏。",
    "file": "leo_comeback_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_comeback_03",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "comeback",
    "text": "这段逆风戏，演得有韧劲。",
    "file": "leo_comeback_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "leo_comeback_04",
    "role": "leo",
    "coachIndex": 2,
    "category": "comeback",
    "text": "劣势追回，好戏重新开场！",
    "file": "leo_comeback_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  }
]
